This extension adds Age of Mythology: Retold modding support to Vortex Mod Manager.

[b]✅ Supported Versions:[/b]
[list]
[*]Steam[/*]
[*]Xbox (Game Pass)[/*]
[*]Other versions may need to select the installation location manually.[/*]
[/list]
[b]🛠️ Mod Installation Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]Installs Save (UserGames) mod with a ".mythsav" file to the "%USERPROFILE%\Games\Age of Mythology Retold\USERID_FOLDER\savegames" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs Config (UserGames) mod with a ".xml" file to the "%USERPROFILE%\Games\Age of Mythology Retold\USERID_FOLDER\users" folder.[/*]
[*]Installs ReShade mod with a file or folder named "reshade-shaders".[/*]
[*]Installs Binaries / Root Game Folder mod with a file with one of these extensions: ".dll" or ".ini".[/*]
[/list]
[b]📋 Usage Notes:[/b]
[list]
[*]You can open several useful files/folders/URLs using the buttons within the folder icon on the Mods toolbar.[/*]
[/list]

